WEBVTT

NOTE
Final Vestige Studios original optional 42-second choice-blindness film caption DRAFT.
NOT RENDERED. Sync to actual recorded audio before playback or release.
All material available in static text without JavaScript.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two choices on the table.
You select one and remember why.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A researcher shows you the other one
as though it were your pick.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:24.000
In a 2005 experiment, some people
did not notice—and explained the substitute.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
That is choice blindness.
It does not establish that commercial audio improves your mind.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before paying for anything, write down the promised feature,
check the actual product and preserve the source.
